	"notes": [
		"Configured from main 78b8a13af28f4eb21134e58194a641f5bf392e59, which still matched remote main on 2026-10-01. The project remains configured-pending-validation; only the independent portal pilot has been validated.",
		"This is the Base Sepolia Beta Web3 platform: root Next DApp, portal, docs-site, Solidity contracts and six Workers; it is not a Cosmos node.",
		"Root packageManager declares npm 11.11.0 and engines node>=22, while the tracked .nvmrc still says v18.16.0. Preserve this discrepancy for doctor; do not change toolchain or locks automatically.",
		"On 2026-10-01, portal's original npm run typecheck and npm run build passed natively with Node 22.23.3/npm 10.9.9. Both scoped CinaCLI plan invocations returned exit 0; portal/check-types and portal/build returned structured success/exit 0. The build produced real dist artifacts and four local fonts. Its first sandbox attempt was denied an ancestor-directory read by esbuild; the identical approved retry passed.",
		"Portal owns its npm lock and declares node>=22.12.0 without a packageManager version. The isolated npm ci --ignore-scripts preserved portal/.npmrc legacy-peer-deps and the lock; root DApp dependencies and install hooks were not run. Portal has no test script; DApp, docs-site, Solidity/Foundry and all six Workers remain pending validation, and this build does not establish on-chain or business runtime acceptance.",
		"The portal build configuration and complete source import closure were inspected: React/Vite/Tailwind/PostCSS use local source, local fonts, portal/design-tokens.css and design/tokens.json. No business API, RPC, wallet, contract, Worker, billing or paymaster startup occurs in this build. Browser-only links and locale/theme scripts are not executed by the build.",
		"The existing contracts:build script was inspected: despite its compile-and-deploy.mjs filename, it only uses solc and writes contracts/out artifacts. Deployment/broadcast scripts and workflows are separate and excluded.",
		"Foundry default profile uses solc 0.8.24; solc-js compilation follows the existing npm lock. forge test may download a missing compiler, so its effects include network-read; compiler/dependency preparation remains separate.",
		"Billing ENABLE_BILLING_USAGE, ENABLE_KEY_REGISTRATION, ENABLE_CUSTODIAL, ENABLE_INGRESS, ENABLE_PUBLIC_LEDGER_READS and ENABLE_INDEXER remain false. Paymaster is disabled with PAYMASTER_ENABLED=false and PAYMASTER_POLICY_MODE=disabled.",
		"No private-key configuration, secret provisioning, RPC broadcasting, on-chain transaction, Worker deployment or production state change is declared."
	],
